4px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\">\n<span>\n           海拔：1200-1500米（蔓飞龙）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;\">\n<span>\n            品种：卡蒂姆 P3/P4\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           采收处理：2025.1.6-1.10（一共是5个Day Lot，1月6号到1月10号每天都有鲜果采收做同样的浮选和后面的发酵处理）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           脱壳到库：2025/5月\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           处理方式：超级日晒 SDN\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           建议养豆：3周起\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           风味：葡萄柚、深色葡萄、蔓越莓、红酒酸、洛神花茶\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           Grapefruit, Dark grape, Cranberry, Winy, Hibiscus tea-like\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           （25产季的总结）今年我们开始尝试减少每次发酵的时间，将一次性长发酵（4周左右）调整为3-4个阶段，这次超级日晒量产批次的处理就是3段式：\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           鲜果浮选，晾晒1天收干表皮水份同时鲜果开始出一些糖液\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           （发酵阶段1）：装晒床旁塑料桶厌氧7天，晒5天；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           （发酵阶段2）：装\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n            晒床旁\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n           塑料桶厌氧2天，晒5天；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           （发酵阶段3）：装\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n            晒床旁\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n           塑料桶厌氧2天，晒5天；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           这样的多段式的目标有两个：能维持或者说有我们所需要的发酵感风味的同时能尽可能呈现咖啡水果的特征，不想只有单一的发酵的酸和酱香类；而且这样多段式每一个阶段也比较灵活可以做微调，从而得到不同风味微调后的结果；相比以往的一段式的更容易操作和复制；（处理一共是5个小批次，因为是5天的鲜果分别采收做的处理，最终晒干后抽样测试后再根据批次的风味特征来做组合，再脱壳厂脱壳时根据合并后的顺序来投料脱壳，这也是我们从2018产季开始的生产加工的品控流程和成品脱壳方式）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmecoa.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmecoa_jpg%2FGr457cyFia7RT1BHQmX3NhPlm1XMhIa0largsA5icjhZbWNPScu7Z6EEjq2BFeETRMaj91TCibtAFIOFqibtkNcR1A%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4074747511880024074\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4074747511880024074\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-w=\"720\">\n</iframe>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           浮选过程视频片段\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RT1BHQmX3NhPlm1XMhIa0l7blRExiajluOyuGRNibB7F3GiaCImmwXoFLWBcf5SBzGKnPZEMGt59HSA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RT1BHQmX3NhPlm1XMhIa0lqkJdJMLn3cRREvZuZG4hzH4qRGibOJyWviapHTlHSADJJYCALmKDic9Aw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           第一个阶段发酵结束，从蓝桶里拿出来晒床晾晒\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           // 以下是24产季的总结\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           （24产季的总结）今年的批次最突出的是酸感，特别的爽口，有一种葡萄酒描述里的那种结构，力量感和很refreshing的爽口感，香气特征入口从红心的葡萄柚到深色的葡萄和蔓越莓的果香，兼具这些水果的果酸，但这还没完，它的酸感会继续延伸到红酒的酒酸质感和洛神花茶的那种酸香，随着温度降低，酸度会柔和一些，口感更为的丝滑～特别棒！一定要养豆养豆，以上风味描述是9.4的样本批次，较粗的研磨；\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Ribgb6X31OXP4rdueyKkLF8iaq1NpbKmPLtrfjIjCyBogVhmZ50m2qZZYzXxEfuEMt74KkTG9DiaDog/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n            关于蔓飞龙\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal;border-style: solid;border-right-width: 0px;border-bottom-width: 0px;border-left-width: 0px;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.098);transform-origin: 0px 0px 0px;transform: scale(1, 0.5);\"/>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           蔓飞龙庄园隶属于云南虹元生物科技有限公司，位于景洪市普文镇曼飞龙村周围的基诺山寨万亩亚热带雨林之中，该区域与西双版纳自然保护区近一步之遥，基地占地面积3000多亩，海拔约1200-1600米，自然植被丰富，土壤肥沃，全年日照充足，昼夜温差大，为咖啡的生长提供了优越的自然环境。\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7RepxrssR6PT9H6KpAH3nAickc2ad0lftzlH0HAFt4PLz6NHRMlrmFscYObICE8XUPLE9ErKPZKztQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           蔓飞龙的名字也有一个故事，通往庄园的山路叫“曼飞龙线”，在傣语中“曼飞龙”意为榕树茂盛的村寨，离庄园不远处就有一棵大榕树，它象征着希望，吉祥，不屈不挠和开拓进取的精神，于是基地就特意取名为蔓飞龙庄园，特意为“曼”加了一个“艹”草字头，象征着生生不息，期望给予庄园更旺盛的生命力。\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n            关于杨蕾\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal;border-style: solid;border-right-width: 0px;border-bottom-width: 0px;border-left-width: 0px;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.098);transform-origin: 0px 0px 0px;transform: scale(1, 0.5);\"/>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           提到蔓飞龙，就必须要介绍杨蕾，一位非常努力，淳朴，智慧的“咖二代”，法国留学生活8年，回国后在上海定居生活，有稳定的工作，家庭和生活状态，但身为蔓飞龙的女儿，她无法割舍对这块林地的依恋，即使生活在大都市中，但时不时还想着怎么能有更好的出路给公司，能让跟着公司号召进山开荒的咖农们看到希望，踏实的生活，于是，工作之余她几乎所有的精力都在魔都的咖啡馆中“走动”，各种咖啡活动与培训课程上总能看到她的身影，2018年3月，我们和杨蕾结识了，开启了这份咖啡缘，我们一起探讨每一个批次的处理，一起测样，一起讨论命名，她做事的严谨，细致让我们深深的佩服，是她保证了每一年度，每一个批次的处理数据的详实，处理过程的执行监督掌控。\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TrZDklsGxp93NntNeIsicr6R4QU6NeNGMpVugLIRnHfEB7dZklVUnOwSrodT1hdT6vIPsxXVatJuQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n            关于大开河冬瓜林橄榄树地\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           2022年开始，经由杨蕾的推动，我们开始在普洱周边的大开河冬瓜林与四户咖农小张，老段和两个小刘家开始配合做处理，其实我们私下已经从认识快4年了，每一次去蔓飞龙，如果碰上小李在山上下不来，或者我们人多，都得需要小张，小刘和老段他们抽空送我们上山，他们也亲自看到了这几年我们在山上（蔓飞龙）做处理一路走来的历程；而他们的加入也让我从田间地头到与咖农的沟通都有了很多新的收获（包括服不服，我感觉我现在也算是玩的可以的哈哈），特别特别自豪的是能亲自带着他们一次次的冲咖啡，杯测咖啡，让他们从完全不喝咖啡的状态变为自发的组织一次次夜咖，能一喝到有问题的咖啡就能感受判断出来，喝到让自己愉悦的也能说出理由，特别的开心～\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SrNdhBwicdHennqUKI7KunnibCoQfUGzSRVOePRr3jVkcflaUbwibnunDDHkSibrLZQeaibWLcXgVg3Ow/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           他们四家的种植地块海拔，地势都不太一样，不过处理晾晒的地方都在相邻，去年我们少少的尝试了一些厌氧发酵处理，今年很多的实验批次都是在冬瓜林完成初步的验证，然后在蔓飞龙山上同步做小批量量产；\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SrNdhBwicdHennqUKI7KunnDf3wEbhxdStQXbc8U5yytk0qXMPhI0KKUTcRfeE8UdqI0EicMSykfQw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"height: 607px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;width: 578px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SrNdhBwicdHennqUKI7KunnbDQoNyibCWU68wuKz88KsogWTkY5D5wME7aEJUgqyjdmBaTw58WSibOg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n            关于今年的处理\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal;border-style: solid;border-right-width: 0px;border-bottom-width: 0px;border-left-width: 0px;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.098);transform-origin: 0px 0px 0px;transform: scale(1, 0.5);\"/>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='text-align: start;caret-color: rgb(73, 73, 73);color: rgb(73, 73, 73);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", \"Apple Color Emoji\", Helvetica, Tahoma, Arial, \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;'>\n<span>\n           今年是第七个年头在蔓飞龙做定制处理，大货批次虽然只有一个，但也是历年来所有小批次一致性最强的一次，往年我们都会把产季3个月里40+个小批次至少在处理完，静置一个月，脱壳前（静置2-3个月）分3次抽样测试，确定风味，主要是发酵感的强弱特征来分类，满足风味发酵感预期的作为我们的超级日晒批次，不满足的薄弱的作为我们的传统日晒也就是轻发酵感批次，往年的结果都是各半的样子或者说1/3是发酵感不满足预期的，去年是0，哈哈，就基本上都还行哦～；除了超级日晒外，也和冬瓜林的小刘小张老段他们做了一些小批次量产的水果浸渍和酵母/酒浸渍的实验批次，虽然还没有很拿得出手的产品，但是又积累了很多新的经验，给即将到来的新产季指引了新的方向～加油！期待2025产季的成果！\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='text-align: start;caret-color: rgb(73, 73, 73);color: rgb(73, 73, 73);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", \"Apple Color Emoji\", Helvetica, Tahoma, Arial, \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;'>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: start;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style='color: rgb(73, 73, 73);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", \"Apple Color Emoji\", Helvetica, Tahoma, Arial, \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, sans-serif;caret-color: rgb(73, 73, 73);font-size: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span>\n            //超级日晒 - Super-Duper Natural\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n<span style='color: rgb(73, 73, 73);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", \"Apple Color Emoji\", Helvetica, Tahoma, Arial, \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, sans-serif;caret-color: rgb(73, 73, 73);font-size: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: start;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgb(73, 73, 73);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", \"Apple Color Emoji\", Helvetica, Tahoma, Arial, \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, sans-serif;caret-color: rgb(73, 73, 73);font-size: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span>\n           它的过程是用咖啡果长时间的自发酵方式带来强烈的发酵风味，我们的这种处理动机是源于2018年时在网络上查询到Elida的一个厌氧发酵产品的处理信息，当时也是有些震惊，怎么能做一个月的发酵？于是，得试试，万一呢，我感觉咖啡人都有一个质疑批判好奇辩证的矛盾体质，于是我们就做了第一“批”，大概有可能四十多个批次，从3天/7天/10天/14天/18天/21天/24天/26天/28天，晒床边高温和房子屋檐下低温，日晒和蜜处理两种大类，结果是出奇的好，有一个批次有90+展望的感觉，还有一个批次有肉桂的香气，而且生豆的外观都很像；当时就有种傲娇，觉得原来这就是秘诀呀，也不难嘛！\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: start;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgb(73, 73, 73);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", \"Apple Color Emoji\", Helvetica, Tahoma, Arial, \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, sans-serif;caret-color: rgb(73, 73, 73);font-size: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span>\n           But，凡事都有但是，但是再想复制就没有再成功过；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: start;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgb(73, 73, 73);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", \"Apple Color Emoji\", Helvetica, Tahoma, Arial, \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, sans-serif;caret-color: rgb(73, 73, 73);font-size: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span>\n           那是第一次感受到，想稳定的做好一个产品，难；它背后有很多很多的心力和精力的投入去管理过程的细节，于是就想了这个自嘲的名字：Super Duper ， 寓意超棒，超牛，时刻鞭挞，等到哪一天我可以完全有信心有能力做好它时我就给他改名；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: start;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgb(73, 73, 73);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", \"Apple Color Emoji\", Helvetica, Tahoma, Arial, \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, sans-serif;caret-color: rgb(73, 73, 73);font-size: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SrNdhBwicdHennqUKI7KunnHcMwF95Pb4llFJpFzVvtRtQWyib9Arol2C4Gdr1qicEJ2aZecRW0PauA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;width: 578px;height: 490px;\"/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: start;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgb(73, 73, 73);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", \"Apple Color Emoji\", Helvetica, Tahoma, Arial, \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, sans-serif;caret-color: rgb(73, 73, 73);font-size: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SDkPWqqibJMjg5sEUP7amleJ0Kk8K6LDpRibhiaXPbvWPbnRgHvErsOC172sgFvqZX8UX4AyBCUx7icg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"height: 516px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;width: 578px;\"/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgb(73, 73, 73);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", \"Apple Color Emoji\", Helvetica, Tahoma, Arial, \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, sans-serif;caret-color: rgb(73, 73, 73);font-size: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: center;\">\n<span>\n            今年继续用大塑胶发酵桶，相比塑胶袋有刚好的密闭性，可以带来更干净的酵感，同时每一个批次的量也可以做的更多一些，提升整体大批次的稳定性。\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n            发酵程度的判断 - 颜色与pH\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SDkPWqqibJMjg5sEUP7amlePicw6afBdnFmfw6hRD5IAeicDyMibnobnKjK7condvDbI98mo9zNKDGOA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 482px;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n<span>\n           果子出袋/桶时的颜色状态\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SDkPWqqibJMjg5sEUP7amle4n6wibgqOeCXSGvtgibYNn5tSVyKwh8psWyrEmV5wB5atgpX50OuYsnA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n<span>\n           超级日晒批次出桶时的pH值（3.7-3.9之间），不做任何发酵液的添加情况下需要3-4周的时间\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n<span>\n           如果有发酵液或者酵母的加入，或者相对高一些的温度可以缩短发酵时长，但是风味会有不同的偏向\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           这是我们的第七个定制处理年头\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           我们期待更长久\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-decoration: line-through;\">\n<span>\n           第五年\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-decoration: line-through;\">\n<span>\n           第六年\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           第八年\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           。。。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           一直做下去\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB